<main class="auth-shell"><section class="auth-panel"><div class="auth-card"><h1>Create your Lightek inbox</h1><p>Confirm your signup email and create a branded mailbox with 250 MB storage and a 20-recipient daily sending allowance. Your inbox remains subject to Lightek’s mail policies.</p><%= form_with url: confirm_member_email_path, data: {turbo: false} do %><%= hidden_field_tag :token, @token %><%= submit_tag 'Confirm and create my inbox', class: 'auth-submit' %><% end %></div></section></main>
